# Normalize every text file to LF, on every platform. Without this a Windows
# checkout (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true) rewrites LF blobs
# to CRLF in the working tree, and scripts that compare on-disk text against
# text they build with \n — e.g. scripts/sync-readme-versions.mjs --check —
# fail spuriously. PNG assets are auto-detected as binary and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
